# Scenario 'browser_pagelist': the browser's page list (START -> ページリスト) with the round-2 site loaded: the icon bar of a row (1 go there, 2 save the current page,
# 3 delete): save into a USED row -> "セーブされているデータを うわがきします。よろしいですか?" first いいえ (the bar stays open), then はい (row selection again);
# delete a used row -> "ページのないようを けします。よろしいですか?" いいえ then はい; delete on an already empty row (nothing); save into an empty row (no question);
# go to an empty row (nothing). Then the session idles in the list for more than ten minutes without a key (the connection-time notice of PageList_Main_Loop),
# then A is pressed every 1500 frames. Starts from the state left by 'browser_pages'; site traces/web/r2 (web=r2). Screen names = my reading of the screenshots.
wait 400
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # title -> top menu (the first A is swallowed by the logo)
waitstable 60 max 600
tap RIGHT
wait 40
tap A                        # ホームページ
waitstable 60 max 900
shot pagelist_tutorial_1
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
shot prompt
tap A                        # ホームページ
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A                        # はい
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A                        # password screen
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
wait 1200
shot index
shot r2_index
tap START
wait 60
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot list
tap A
wait 60
tap RIGHT
wait 40
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot q1
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot after_no
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
tap LEFT
wait 40
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot after_yes
tap A
wait 60
tap RIGHT x2
wait 40
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot del_q
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot del_no
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
tap LEFT
wait 40
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot del_yes
tap A
wait 60
tap RIGHT x2
wait 40
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot del_empty
tap B
wait 60
tap DOWN x3
wait 100
tap A
wait 60
tap RIGHT
wait 40
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot save_row4
tap DOWN
wait 60
tap A
wait 60
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot goto_empty
# --- idle in the page list until the ten-minute notice (no key for 22000 frames, then A every 1500 frames)
wait 8000
shot idle_a
wait 14000
shot idle_b
tap A
wait 1500
shot idle_c0
tap A
wait 1500
shot idle_c1
tap A
wait 1500
shot idle_c2
tap A
wait 1500
shot idle_c3
tap A
wait 1500
shot idle_c4
tap A
wait 1500
shot idle_c5
tap A
wait 1500
shot idle_c6
tap A
wait 1500
shot idle_c7
